><b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Contemporary Kitchen Interior</b>: <response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><link-block _nghost-ng-c444136389=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><a _ngcontent-ng-c444136389=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" externallink=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2284763090=\"\" jslog=\"197247;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_ec5e3626f7c8aaaa&quot;,&quot;c_3d95e8eaa9cf45ee&quot;,null,&quot;rc_2683bb49b8a5e040&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]\" href=\"https://unsplash.com/s/photos/modern-kitchen\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwjEjoHgyq6WAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQkAI\">https://unsplash.com/s/photos/modern-kitchen</a><!----></link-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Photoshop Layer Organization Guide for 100% Freepik Approval</b></p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Layer Group Hierarchy Structure</b></p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\">📁 [Template] - 1080x1080 Real Estate Flyer<br>├── 📁 01_TEXT &amp; CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 01_Header (Logo &amp; Social Follow Us Text)<br>│   ├── 📁 02_Main Headline Block (Select Your Luxury House)<br>│   ├── 📁 03_Description Paragraph<br>│   ├── 📁 04_Price Tag Text (Price Started At $ 2,300,00)<br>│   ├── 📁 05_Inset Image Labels (Bedroom &amp; Kitchen)<br>│   └── 📁 06_Footer Contact &amp; Website Info<br>├── 📁 02_BUTTONS &amp; ICONS<br>│   ├── 🎨 [Button] Book Now Crimson Pill (#B8333D)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Price Banner Crimson Container (#B8333D)<br>│   ├── 📁 Top-Right Social Media Icon Glyphs<br>│   ├── 📁 Inset Card Dark Pill Labels (#8C222A)<br>│   └── 📁 Logo Vector House Glyph<br>├── 📁 03_IMAGE HOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main House Frame - Double Click to Edit<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Bedroom Inset Frame - Double Click to Edit<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Kitchen Inset Frame - Double Click to Edit<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Background House Blurred - Double Click to Edit<br>└── 📁 04_BACKGROUND &amp; VECTOR SHAPES<br>    ├── 🎨 Top-Right Crimson Header Card (#B8333D)<br>    ├── 🎨 Bottom-Left Crimson Corner Wave (#B8333D)<br>    ├── 🎨 3 Custom Rounded Photo Frames &amp; Drop Shadows<br>    └── 🎨 Base Canvas Background Layer (#F2F4F7)</p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Approval Checklist</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Smart Object Placeholders:</b> Convert each of the 3 inset photo cards (Main Exterior, Bedroom, Kitchen) and the blurred backdrop into separate <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"140\">Smart Objects</b> clipped to their respective rounded vector masks labeled <i data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"211\">\"DOUBLE CLICK TO REPLACE IMAGE\"</i>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vector Shapes Only:</b> Construct all asymmetric rounded card frames, the top-right social container, bottom-left crimson corner wave, and CTA button strictly using Photoshop\'s non-destructive Vector Shape Tools (<code data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"209\">U</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Editable Text Layers:</b> Maintain all headline words, italics formatting, pricing figures, photo tags, CTA copy, and phone numbers as live, native editable type layers.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Layer Group Color Labels:</b> Mark <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">TEXT &amp; CONTENT</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"49\">Red</b>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">BUTTONS &amp; ICONS</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">Green</b>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">IMAGE HOLDERS</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">Yellow</b>, and <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">BACKGROUND</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">Blue</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Clean File Finalization:</b> Delete all hidden test layers, empty groups, and temporary guide lines before exporting the final <code data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">.PSD</code> file for upload.</p></li></ul>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a869fefdf4d3.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-psd/real-estate-house-property-instagram-post-social-media-banner-template_24504736.htm\"]', 1, 6, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 15175, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cvB_gmYwOVnn2wHfHONQtrL3wAUanZFR?usp=drive_link', '2026-08-20 05:40:11', '2026-08-26 07:57:33', '2026-08-20 09:53:35', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-20', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-20 11:20:06', NULL, NULL, 'manual', NULL);
