ter Contact &amp; Website Info<br>├── 📁 02_BUTTONS &amp; ICONS<br>│   ├── 🎨 [Button] Book Now Pill (#8C6EDF to #4B3D96)<br>│   ├── 📁 Checklist Purple Checkmark Glyphs<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Vector Icons (Globe &amp; Phone)<br>├── 📁 03_IMAGE HOLDER (Smart Object)<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] House Exterior Photo - Double Click to Edit<br>└── 📁 04_BACKGROUND &amp; VECTOR SHAPES<br>    ├── 🎨 Purple Side Traingles (L &amp; R Pointers)<br>    ├── 🎨 Dynamic Upper Purple Arch shape<br>    ├── 🎨 Dynamic Lower Dark Purple Arch shape<br>    └── 🎨 Clean White Canvas Base</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" class=\"\">Key Approval Checklist</strong></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" class=\"\">Smart Object Placeholders:</strong><span class=\"\"> Convert the curved upward wave containing the house photo into a dedicated </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"102\" class=\"\">Smart Object</strong><span class=\"\"> labeled </span><em data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\" class=\"\">\"DOUBLE CLICK TO REPLACE IMAGE\"</em><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" class=\"\">Vector Shapes Only:</strong><span class=\"\"> Construct all dynamic arches,</span><span class=\"\"> triangles,</span><span class=\"\"> pill buttons,</span><span class=\"\"> and checklist icons strictly using Photoshop\'s non-destructive Vector Shape Tools (</span><code data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"158\" class=\"\">U</code><span class=\"\">).</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" class=\"\">Editable Text Layers:</strong><span class=\"\"> Maintain all typography (headlines,</span><span class=\"\"> checklist items,</span><span class=\"\"> footer details,</span><span class=\"\"> etc.</span><span class=\"\">) as live,</span><span class=\"\"> unflattened type layers.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" class=\"\">Layer Group Color Labels:</strong><span class=\"\"> Mark </span><code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\" class=\"\">TEXT &amp; CONTENT</code><span class=\"\"> in </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"49\" class=\"\">Red</strong><span class=\"\">,</span><span class=\"\"> </span><code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\" class=\"\">BUTTONS &amp; ICONS</code><span class=\"\"> in </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\" class=\"\">Green</strong><span class=\"\">,</span><span class=\"\"> </span><code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\" class=\"\">IMAGE HOLDER</code><span class=\"\"> in </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"96\" class=\"\">Yellow</strong><span class=\"\">,</span><span class=\"\"> and </span><code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"108\" class=\"\">BACKGROUND</code><span class=\"\"> in </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"122\" class=\"\">Blue</strong><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" class=\"\">Clean File Finalization:</strong><span class=\"\"> Purge all hidden test layers,</span><span class=\"\"> empty groups,</span><span class=\"\"> and temporary guide lines before exporting the final </span><code data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"122\" class=\"\">.PSD</code><span class=\"\"> file.</span><span class=\"\">```</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a86bc0aa2bb9.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/premium-psd/real-estate-social-media-post-banner-templ