usinessman-laptop)</p><br><p>* **Corporate Office Executive with Reports**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/corporate-worker](https://unsplash.com/s/photos/corporate-worker)</p><br><br><p>---</p><br><br><p>**Photoshop Layer Group Hierarchy**</p><br><br><p>```text</p><br><p>📁 [Template] - Corporate Business Flyer (Green)</p><br><p>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)</p><br><p>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)</p><br><p>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)</p><br><p>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Header &amp; Logo Text</p><br><p>│   │   └── T COMPANY</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Chart Text</p><br><p>│   │   ├── T LOREM</p><br><p>│   │   └── T IPSUM</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Main Headlines</p><br><p>│   │   ├── T BUSINESS</p><br><p>│   │   ├── T FLYER</p><br><p>│   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Intro Paragraph)</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Feature List Items</p><br><p>│   │   ├── 📁 Point 01</p><br><p>│   │   │   ├── T LOREM IPSUM (Title)</p><br><p>│   │   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Description)</p><br><p>│   │   └── 📁 Point 02</p><br><p>│   │       ├── T LOREM IPSUM (Title)</p><br><p>│   │       └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Description)</p><br><p>│   └── 📁 Footer Text</p><br><p>│       └── T mybusiness.com</p><br><p>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Header Logo Icon (White circle \'C\' emblem)</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 User Profile Vector Icon (Green)</p><br><p>│   └── 📁 Email Envelope Vector Icon (Green)</p><br><p>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)</p><br><p>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Circular Hero (Businessman at Desk) - Replace Here</p><br><p>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES</p><br><p>│   ├── 🎨 Hero Concentric Border Rings (Dark Green &amp; Lime Green)</p><br><p>│   ├── 🎨 Hero Swirling Leaf Vector Accents</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Donut Chart Segments</p><br><p>│   │   ├── 🎨 Segment 01 - Light Green (#72BF44)</p><br><p>│   │   ├── 🎨 Segment 02 - Dark Green (#0F5A38)</p><br><p>│   │   ├── 🎨 Segment 03 - Dark Grey (#