(225, 'FLYER 41', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Travel &amp; Tour Agency A4 Flyer\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_navy\": \"#172340\",<br>    \"accent_orange\": \"#F37021\",<br>    \"gradient_orange_light\": \"#FFA500\",<br>    \"text_dark_navy\": \"#172340\",<br>    \"text_grey\": \"#757575\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600, 800, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Main headlines, pricing, bold titles, logo\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body paragraphs, contact details\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"header_section\": {<br>      \"background_shape\": \"Dark navy blue curved polygon anchoring the top-left corner\",<br>      \"logo\": {<br>        \"icon\": \"White abstract swoosh with an orange core/swirl\",<br>        \"brand_name\": \"COMPANY NAME (White, Bold)\",<br>        \"slogan\": \"TAGLINE HERE (White, Regular)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"hero_section\": {<br>      \"image\": \"Scenic photo of a traditional Asian pagoda on a lake at sunset\",<br>      \"mask_shape\": \"Large sweeping concave wave carving out the middle and top right of the canvas\",<br>      \"vector_accents\": {<br>        \"swoosh\": \"Thick orange curved band outlining the bottom edge of the image mask\",<br>        \"circle\": \"Dark navy solid circle tucked behind the bottom right of the orange swoosh\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"promotional_badge\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Floating on the mid-left, overlapping the hero image and white background\",<br>      \"shape\": \"Scalloped/starburst circle with an orange-to-yellow radial gradient, featuring a thin white inner offset stroke and a drop shadow\",<br>      \"text_lines\": [<br>        \"start from (White, Regular)\",<br>        \"$499 (White, Heavy/Large)\",<br>        \"per person (White, Regular)\"<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"middle_typography_section\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Center of the white background space\",<br>      \"sub_headline\": {<br>        \"line_1\": \"EXPLORE ASIA (Navy, Bold)\",<br>        \"line_2\": \"BEST DESTINATION (Grey, Light)\"<br>      },<br>      \"main_headline\": {<br>        \"line_1\": \"FLYER TITLE (Navy, Heavy/Black)\",<br>        \"line_2\": \"TRAVEL FLYER TEMPLATE (Grey, Light)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"content_columns_section\": {<br>      \"layout\": \"Three equal vertical text columns aligned horizontally\",<br>      \"dividers\": \"Two dark navy vertical lines separating the columns\",<br>      \"body_text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit...\"<br>    },<br>    \"footer_section\": {<br>      \"background\": \"Solid dark navy blue block at the bottom, topped with a thin orange wave curve spanning the canvas width\",<br>      \"left_contact\": {<br>        \"icon\": \"White location pin\",<br>        \"text\": \"Head Office / St. Lorem No. 7, NY City\"<br>      },<br>      \"center_contact\": {<br>        \"icon\": \"White phone receiver\",<br>        \"text\": \"+12 222 453\"<br>      },<br>      \"right_social\": {<br>        \"icons\": \"Instagram, Facebook, and Twitter icons (Navy) inside solid white circles\"<br>      }<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>### **Freepik PSD A4 Blueprint: Logical Grouping Structure**<br><br>As requested, I have organized this PSD blueprint using a highly functional, industry-standard layer hierarchy. Grouping by **Photoshop Layer Type** (Text, Shapes, Smart Objects) ensures reviewers and end-users can quickly navigate, edit, and localize the template without searching through nested visual quadrants.<br><br>**Layer Group Hierarchy Structure**<br><br>```text<br>📁 [Template] - Travel Tour Agency Flyer<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Header Text<br>│   │   ├── T COMPANY NAME<br>│   │   └── T TAGLINE HERE<br>│   ├── 📁 Promo Badge Text<br>│   │   ├── T start from<br>│   │   ├── T $499<br>│   │   └── T per person<br>│   ├── 📁 Main Headlines<br>│   │   ├── T EXPLORE ASIA<br>│   │   ├── T BEST DESTINATION<br>│   │   ├── T FLYER TITLE<br>│   │   └── T TRAVEL FLYER TEMPLATE<br>│   ├── 📁 3-Column Paragraphs<br>│   │   ├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Left)<br>│   │   ├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Center)<br>│   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Right)<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Contact<br>│       ├── T Head Office<br>│       ├── T St. Lorem No. 7, NY City<br>│       └── T +12 222 453<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS<br>│   ├── 📁 Logo Icon (White swoosh &amp; Orange swirl)<br>│   ├── 📁 Social Media (Instagram, Facebook, Twitter)<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Icons (Location Pin, Phone)<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Travel Destination Image - Replace Here<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Promo Badge Starburst (Orange Gradient + Drop Shadow)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Promo Badge Inner Outline (Thin White Stroke)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Text Column Dividers (Navy Vertical Lines x2)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Image Mask Sweep (Vector Mask applied to Smart Object)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Thick Orange Wave Accent (Below image)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Dark Navy Circle Accent (Right edge)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Top Left Navy Corner Polygon<br>│   ├── 🎨 Thin Orange Footer Wave<br>│   ├── 🎨 Navy Footer Background Block<br>│   └── 🎨 White Circles for Social Icons<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid Base Canvas (#FFFFFF)<br><br>```<br><br>**Workflow Benefits of this Structure:**<br><br>* **One-Click Text Editing:** All typography is localized in `02_TEXT_CONTENT`. A user does not need to unlock background layers or navigate through graphical folders to change the destination, price, or dummy text.<br>* **Isolated Vector Assets:** The complex curved elements (like the sweeping orange wave and the starburst badge) are housed cleanly in `05_VECTOR_SHAPES`. This prevents accidental nudging while users update text or swap images.<br>* **Smart Object Visibility:** Placing the hero image Smart Object in its own dedicated top-level folder makes customization explicitly clear for buyers.</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8bd2f125e50.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/travel-flyer-template_4003566.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=39&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 10, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'In Review', 0, 'Paused', NULL, 5618, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I9GD9Gk6DiKmhnZ3kFSDSMpKYB-xcH5b?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 04:21:50', '2026-08-25 03:36:36', '2026-08-25 03:36:36', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'manual', NULL),
(226, 'FLYER 42', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Corporate Creative Studio Business Flyer\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_lime_green\": \"#8CB811\",<br>    \"dark_slate_grey\": \"#2F373E\",<br>    \"light_grey_ribbon\": \"#E5E8EB\",<br>    \"text_dark_black\": \"#1A1A1A\",<br>    \"text_grey\": \"#777777\",<br>    \"text_white\": \"#FFFFFF\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600, 700, 800, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Main headlines, brand ribbon, section titles, logo\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body paragraphs, top right header text, URL\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"top_header_section\": {<br>      \"top_left_tab\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Angled lime-green polygon banner (#8CB811)\",<br>        \"text\": \"WWW.WEBSITE.COM (White, Bold, Tracked out)\"<br>      },<br>      \"top_right_info\": {<br>        \"accent\": \"Small lime-green square and dark vertical line icon\",<br>        \"text\": \"Ut aliquam sollicitudin leo.\\nCras iaculis ultricies nulla.\\nCras ornare tristique elit.\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"hero_section\": {<br>      \"background_image\": {<br>        \"description\": \"Black and white city skyline with the Empire State Building / New York skyscrapers\",<br>        \"mask\": \"Sweeping organic diagonal wave cutting from mid-left to mid-right\"<br>      },<br>      \"headline_composition\": {<br>        \"top_ribbon\": {<br>          \"shape\": \"Light grey horizontal capsule/box (#E5E8EB)\",<br>          \"text\": \"BUSINESS DESIGN (Black, Bold, Tracked out)\"<br>        },<br>        \"middle_green_tag\": {<br>          \"shape\": \"Lime-green angled trapezoid ribbon with right-side tail stroke\",<br>          \"text\": \"CREATIVE STUDIO (White, Bold)\"<br>        },<br>        \"large_watermark_text\": \"T (Massive black letter \'T\' anchoring the left side of the headline block)\",<br>        \"main_title\": \"EMPLATE (Black, Bold - combines with \'T\' to form \'TEMPLATE\')\",<br>        \"underline\": \"Thick black horizontal bar under the title\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"middle_divider_waves\": {<br>      \"style\": \"Dynamic multi-layered sweeping vector curves separating the hero image and content section\",<br>      \"layers\": [<br>        \"Top Layer: Lime Green Wave (#8CB811)\",<br>        \"Middle Layer: Thin White Gap Curve\",<br>        \"Base Layer: Dark Slate Grey Solid Wave (#2F373E)\"<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"three_columns_content_section\": {<br>      \"background\": \"Solid Dark Slate Grey (#2F373E)\",<br>      \"dividers\": \"Two vertical white divider lines separating the three feature blocks\",<br>      \"columns\": [<br>        {<br>          \"icon\": \"Thumbs up / Hand gesture outline (Lime Green)\",<br>          \"title\": \"Creative\\nConcept (White, Bold)\",<br>          \"description\": \"Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard scrambled it to make a type specimen book. Add SOME TEXT HERE\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"icon\": \"Growing bar chart with upward arrow (Lime Green)\",<br>          \"title\": \"Market\\nAnalysis (White, Bold)\",<br>          \"description\": \"Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard scrambled it to make a type specimen book. Add SOME TEXT HERE\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"icon\": \"Double interlocking gears / cogs (Lime Green)\",<br>          \"title\": \"Strategy\\nPlanner (White, Bold)\",<br>          \"description\": \"Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard scrambled it to make a type specimen book. Add SOME TEXT HERE\"<br>        }<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"footer_section\": {<br>      \"background\": \"Solid white base framed by overlapping lime-green and dark slate wave tails\",<br>      \"logo_block\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Bottom-Right corner\",<br>        \"icon\": \"Two overlapping triangle wedges (Dark Grey and Lime Green)\",<br>        \"brand_text\": \"FLYER (Lime Green, Heavy Bold)\",<br>        \"sub_text\": \"TEMPLATE (Dark Grey, Light Caps)\",<br>        \"sub_brand\": \"yer (Dark Grey, Bold - combined with FL to form \'FLYER\')\"<br>      }<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>**Free Font Download Links (Google Fonts)**<br><br>* **Montserrat Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat)<br>* **Open Sans Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans)<br><br>**Icon Links &amp; Glyph Codes (Photoshop / Illustrator)**<br><br>* **FontAwesome Official Download**: [https://fontawesome.com/download](https://fontawesome.com/download)<br>* **Thumbs Up / Like Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/like_1077063) | Glyph: `\\f164`<br>* **Market Growth Chart Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/bar-chart_1055644) | Glyph: `\\f080`<br>* **Gears / Settings Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/gears_874554) | Glyph: `\\f085`<br><br>**Commercial-Use Placeholder Image Sources (Unsplash)**<br><br>* **New York Skyline &amp; Empire State Building**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/new-york-skyline](https://unsplash.com/s/photos/new-york-skyline)<br>* **Modern Grayscale Architecture Cityscape**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/black-and-white-city](https://unsplash.com/s/photos/black-and-white-city)<br><br>---<br><br>**Photoshop Layer Group Hierarchy**<br><br>```text<br>📁 [Template] - Corporate Creative Studio Flyer<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Top Header Text<br>│   │   ├── T WWW.WEBSITE.COM<br>│   │   └── T Ut aliquam sollicitudin leo... (Top Right 3-lines)<br>│   ├── 📁 Headline Composition<br>│   │   ├── T BUSINESS DESIGN<br>│   │   ├── T CREATIVE STUDIO<br>│   │   ├── T T (Oversized Anchor Letter)<br>│   │   └── T EMPLATE<br>│   ├── 📁 Feature Columns (Dark Section)<br>│   │   ├── 📁 Column 01 (Creative Concept)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Creative Concept<br>│   │   │   ├── T Lorem Ipsum has been...<br>│   │   │   └── T Add SOME TEXT HERE (Lime Green)<br>│   │   ├── 📁 Column 02 (Market Analysis)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Market Analysis<br>│   │   │   ├── T Lorem Ipsum has been...<br>│   │   │   └── T Add SOME TEXT HERE (Lime Green)<br>│   │   └── 📁 Column 03 (Strategy Planner)<br>│   │       ├── T Strategy Planner<br>│   │       ├── T Lorem Ipsum has been...<br>│   │       └── T Add SOME TEXT HERE (Lime Green)<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Brand Logo<br>│       ├── T FL<br>│       ├── T yer<br>│       └── T TEMPLATE<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES<br>│   ├── 📁 Top Right Accent Dot / Line<br>│   ├── 📁 Thumbs Up Icon (Lime Green Vector)<br>│   ├── 📁 Bar Chart Icon (Lime Green Vector)<br>│   ├── 📁 Double Gears Icon (Lime Green Vector)<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Logo Geometric Shapes (Overlapping Triangles)<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Cityscape Grayscale Hero - Replace Here<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Top Left URL Polygon Banner (Lime Green)<br>│   ├── 🎨 \'BUSINESS DESIGN\' Light Grey Ribbon Box<br>│   ├── 🎨 \'CREATIVE STUDIO\' Lime Green Angled Ribbon<br>│   ├── 🎨 Headline Underline Bar (Black)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Sweeping Lime Green Wave Divider<br>│   ├── 🎨 Sweeping Dark Slate Grey Body Block (#2F373E)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Column Vertical Divider Lines (x2 Thin White Lines)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Bottom Right Corner Lime Green Wave Accent<br>│   └── 🎨 Bottom Right Corner Dark Slate Wave Accent<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid White Canvas Base (#FFFFFF)<br><br>```<br><br>**Freepik Approval Quality Checklist**<br><br>* **Smart Objects:** The black and white New York cityscape must be placed in a dedicated **Smart Object** clipped to the upper vector wave mask labeled *\"Double Click to Edit\"*.<br>* **True Vectors:** Construct the top angled URL tab, headline ribbon boxes, multi-layered wave curves, and footer accent flourishes exclusively using Photoshop Vector Shape Tools (`U`).<br>* **Editable Typography:** Ensure all text layers remain live and editable—including the split *\"T\"* + *\"EMPLATE\"* typographic treatment and green highlighted *\"Add SOME TEXT HERE\"* snippets.<br>* **Pre-Press Compliance:** Verify the document profile is set to **CMYK / 300 DPI** with standard **3mm bleeds** applied to all canvas edges.</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8d0ea6d3e84.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/corporate-flyer_3835735.htm\"]', 1, 10, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'In Progress', 0, 'Paused', NULL, 6, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I9GD9Gk6DiKmhnZ3kFSDSMpKYB-xcH5b?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 04:22:29', '2026-08-29 04:15:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'manual', NULL),
