re-or-less normal distribution of letters, as opposed to using \'Content here, content here\', making it look like readable English. Many desktop publishing packages and web page editors now use Lorem Ipsum as their default model text, and a search for \'lorem ipsum\' will uncover many web sites still in their infancy. Various versions have evolved over the years, sometimes by accident, sometimes on purpose (injected humour and the like).\"<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"signoff_section\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Below the body text, aligned to the bottom-left\",<br>      \"sender_details\": {<br>        \"label\": \"From,\",<br>        \"name\": \"JONATHAN RINE (Red, Bold)\",<br>        \"designation\": \"Creative Designer (Dark Grey)\"<br>      },<br>      \"signature_block\": {<br>        \"signature_text\": \"Jonathan Rine (Handwritten Script Style)\",<br>        \"divider_line\": \"Thin horizontal grey underline\",<br>        \"label\": \"SIGNATURE (Dark Slate, Tracked Caps)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"bottom_right_contact_block\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Bottom-right side anchored to the right margin\",<br>      \"folded_ribbon_tab\": {<br>        \"style\": \"Vertical 3D red ribbon tab attached to the right border stripe with dark red fold shadows\",<br>        \"icons\": [<br>          \"White phone handset icon inside white circular outline\",<br>          \"White globe/web icon inside white circular outline\",<br>          \"White location pin icon inside white circular outline\"<br>        ]<br>      },<br>      \"contact_labels\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Left of the vertical red ribbon tab, right-aligned text\",<br>        \"phone_lines\": [\"+1-718-310-5588\", \"+1-313-381-8167\"],<br>        \"web_lines\": [\"www.yourwebsite.com\", \"yourinfo@email.com\"],<br>        \"address_lines\": [\"769 Prudence Street\", \"Lincoln Park, MI 48146\"]<br>      }<br>    }<br>  }<br>}</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8eadbb2aa6a.webp