(429, 'FLYER 02', '<p>Here is a highly commercial, **Sharp Geometric Variant** of the original red and orange corporate flyer.<br><br>To make this a top-tier, modern microstock asset, this layout replaces the dated, soft organic waves with bold, sharp diagonal cuts. Diagonal layouts are incredibly popular in the corporate category because they convey momentum, precision, and a forward-thinking aesthetic.<br><br>The hero image is shifted to the right, sliced by a sharp diagonal line, while the left side uses a solid red polygon to anchor the main headline and logo. All original text, colors, and branding elements remain exactly the same.<br><br>### **JSON Blueprint: Geometric Diagonal Variant**<br><br>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Corporate Business A4 Flyer Template - Modern Diagonal Variant\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_red\": \"#B90000\",<br>    \"secondary_dark_red\": \"#8B0000\",<br>    \"accent_orange\": \"#FF8C00\",<br>    \"text_dark_grey\": \"#333333\",<br>    \"text_light_grey\": \"#999999\",<br>    \"footer_grey\": \"#D3D3D3\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"hero_and_header_section\": {<br>      \"layout_style\": \"Diagonal split across the top 55% of the canvas\",<br>      \"left_polygon\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large solid red (#B90000) diagonal wedge filling the top-left and angling down to the right\",<br>        \"logo\": {<br>          \"position\": \"Top-left corner, inside the red polygon (Logo text inverted to white)\",<br>          \"icon\": \"Two overlapping diamonds (orange and white) with a white curved swoosh\",<br>          \"brand_name\": \"YOUR LOGO\",<br>          \"slogan\": \"YOUR SLOGAN HERE\"<br>        },<br>        \"headline_group\": {<br>          \"position\": \"Middle-left, anchored inside the red polygon\",<br>          \"main_text\": \"WE ARE YOUR BEST CHOICE (White, italicized caps)\",<br>          \"sub_text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, (White)\"<br>        }<br>      },<br>      \"right_image\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large triangular wedge filling the top-right\",<br>        \"image\": \"Grayscale city skyscrapers (masked to the diagonal cut)\",<br>        \"accent_stroke\": \"Thick orange (#FF8C00) diagonal line separating the red polygon and the image\",<br>        \"floating_text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur (White, right-aligned, floating in the top-right corner of the image)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"middle_content_section\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Lower 45% of the canvas on a solid white base\",<br>      \"heading_block\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Centered just below the diagonal cut\",<br>        \"main_heading\": \"WHO WE ARE? (Dark Grey)\",<br>        \"body_text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt. Ut laoreet dolore magna aliquam erat volutpat.\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"services_columns\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Centered below the \'WHO WE ARE?\' paragraph\",<br>      \"sub_heading\": \"Our Services (Orange, centered above columns)\",<br>      \"layout\": \"Three equal columns separated by thin vertical grey lines\",<br>      \"columns\": [<br>        {<br>          \"number\": \"01\",<br>          \"title\": \"Aliquam sit amet (Orange, italic)\",<br>          \"text\": \"ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum id tortor porta, eleifend purus vel, sagittis purus.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"number\": \"02\",<br>          \"title\": \"Aliquam sit amet (Orange, italic)\",<br>          \"text\": \"ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum id tortor porta, eleifend purus vel, sagittis purus.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"number\": \"03\",<br>          \"title\": \"Aliquam sit amet (Orange, italic)\",<br>          \"text\": \"ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum id tortor porta, eleifend purus vel, sagittis purus.\"<br>        }<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"footer_section\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Absolute bottom margin\",<br>      \"background\": \"Solid light grey (#D3D3D3) horizontal band\",<br>      \"text_line_1\": \"CONTACT US FOR MORE INFORMATION\",<br>      \"text_line_2\": \"Call us : +445368792  Web : www.yourbusiness.com\"<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>---<br><br>### **Your Master Layer Group Hierarchy**<br><br>I am strictly maintaining your exact layer structure, spelling, and folder organization. The visual layout has been modernized, but the PSD file framework remains identical to your trusted DNA.<br><br>```text<br>📁 Logo<br>├── 🖼️ &gt;&gt; Dubble Click Here (Overlapping Diamonds &amp; Swoosh Logo Icon)<br>├── T YOUR LOGO<br>└── T YOUR SLOGAN HERE<br><br>📁 OFFERE<br>└── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur (Right-aligned text floating over image)<br><br>📁 Headline<br>├── T WE ARE YOUR BEST CHOICE<br>├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer... <br>├── 🎨 Line (Hidden or unused in this specific layout)<br>├── T WHO WE ARE?<br>└── 📁 Bg<br>    └── 🎨 Bg (Large solid red diagonal polygon wedge)<br><br>📁 Top Image<br>└── 🖼️ &lt;&lt;&lt;Double Click Here (B&amp;W Skyscraper image, masked to a sharp diagonal cut)<br><br>📁 Small Image<br>├── 📁 Image-3 (Service 03 Column)<br>│   ├── 📁 Text<br>│   │   ├── T 03<br>│   │   ├── T Aliquam sit amet<br>│   │   └── T ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum...<br>│   ├── 🎨 Bg (Hidden)<br>│   └── 🖼️ &lt;&lt;&lt; Double Click Here (Hidden)<br>├── 📁 Image-2 (Service 02 Column)<br>│   ├── 📁 Text<br>│   │   ├── T 02<br>│   │   ├── T Aliquam sit amet<br>│   │   └── T ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum...<br>│   ├── 🎨 Bg (Hidden)<br>│   └── 🖼️ &lt;&lt;&lt; Double Click Here (Hidden)<br>└── 📁 Image-1 (Service 01 Column)<br>    ├── 📁 Text<br>    │   ├── T 01<br>    │   ├── T Aliquam sit amet<br>    │   └── T ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum...<br>    ├── 🎨 Bg (Hidden)<br>    └── 🖼️ &lt;&lt;&lt; Double Click Here (Hidden)<br><br>📁 About Property<br>├── T Our Services (Orange Subheading)<br>├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Paragraph under WHO WE ARE?)<br>└── 📁 Under Line<br>    ├── 🎨 Shape 2 (Right vertical grey divider line)<br>    └── 🎨 Shape 1 (Left vertical grey divider line)<br><br>📁 For sale &amp; Prize<br>├── T (Hidden text layer)<br>└── T (Hidden text layer)<br><br>📁 QR Code<br>├── 🖼️ Qr Code (Hidden placeholder)<br>└── 🎨 Rectangle 6 (Hidden placeholder)<br><br>📁 Get in touch<br>├── T CONTACT US FOR MORE INFORMATION<br>├── T Call us : +445368792 <br>├── T Web : www.yourbusiness.com<br>├── T (Hidden text layer)<br>└── 📁 Line<br>    ├── 🎨 Shape 6 copy (Thick orange diagonal stroke line bordering the image)<br>    ├── 🎨 Shape 6 (Hidden or unused in this variant)<br>    └── 🎨 Shape 1 (Solid light grey footer background rectangle)<br><br>📁 Background<br>└── 🎨 Background Color (Solid White Base)<br><br>```</p>', NULL, '[\"uploads/task_images/task_6a8eca3839547.webp\"]', '[\"uploads/task_images/task_6a8eca33f114b.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/abstract-business-flyer-template_5336450.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=1&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 1, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'To-Do', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 0, NULL, '2026-08-26 11:13:05', '2026-08-26 11:13:05', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-26', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'manual', NULL),
