om-left dark charcoal triangular corner block\",<br>        \"Large diagonal royal blue (#0078C8) rounded capsule container with white border stroke\",<br>        \"Parallel floating sky blue (#56B4E9) diagonal rounded pill strokes\"<br>      ]<br>    }<br>  }<br>}</p>', '[]', '[\"uploads/task_images/task_6a8fe23503d50.webp\"]', '[\"uploads/task_images/task_6a8fe3119eb0d.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/premium-psd/modern-business-corporate-letterhead-template_42428537.htm\"]', 1, 2, 'Motion Graphics', 2, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 8298, '', '2026-08-27 07:11:18', '2026-08-27 09:44:24', '2026-08-27 09:31:34', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-27', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-27 09:44:24', NULL, NULL, 'manual', NULL),
