blue polygonal shapes with diagonal peaks and a slanted lower boundary.\"},{\"section\":\"LETTER METADATA\",\"description\":\"Small cyan sender-name label and gray contact/address lines aligned beneath the logo on the left, with the date positioned toward the upper-right side of the writing area.\"},{\"section\":\"MAIN LETTER CONTENT\",\"description\":\"Several compact left-aligned paragraphs in small gray sans-serif type, arranged in a narrow central writing column with generous white space and consistent line spacing.\"},{\"section\":\"SIGN-OFF AREA\",\"description\":\"Handwritten-style signature treatment placed near the lower-left portion of the page, followed by a small printed name and role/title.\"},{\"section\":\"BOTTOM CONTACT BLOCK\",\"description\":\"Right-aligned contact information stack in muted gray at the lower-right, accompanied by four small cyan square social/contact icon buttons.\"},{\"section\":\"BOTTOM ABSTRACT GRAPHIC\",\"description\":\"Angular cyan and blue polygon ribbons rise from the bottom edge, balanced by a deep charcoal diagonal wedge and a narrow cyan baseline accent.\"}],\"assets_links\":[{\"type\":\"font\",\"name\":\"Montserrat\",\"url\":\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat\",\"license\":\"Free Commercial License\"},{\"type\":\"font\",\"name\":\"Open Sans\",\"url\":\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans\",\"license\":\"Free Commercial License\"},{\"type\":\"font\",\"name\":\"Great Vibes\",\"url\":\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Great+Vibes\",\"license\":\"Free Commercial License\"},{\"type\":\"icon_font\",\"name\":\"Font Awesome Free\",\"note\":\"Optional source for phone, email, globe and social contact symbols used in the footer icon buttons\",\"url\":\"https://fontawesome.com/download\"},{\"type\":\"vector\",\"name\":\"Dream Studio Logo Mark\",\"note\":\"Recreate as editable cyan geometric outline emblem with separate wordmark and subtitle\",\"url\":\"https://www.adobe.com/products/illustrator.html\"},{\"typ