ation Icon\",\"type\":\"vector\",\"icon\":\"📁\"}]},{\"folder\":\"04_SIGNATURE_&_DETAILS\",\"layers\":[{\"name\":\"Handwritten Signature - Editable\",\"type\":\"smart_object\",\"icon\":\"🖼️\"},{\"name\":\"Signature Ink Texture\",\"type\":\"raster\",\"icon\":\"🖌️\"},{\"name\":\"Date and Document Metadata\",\"type\":\"text\",\"icon\":\"📁\"}]},{\"folder\":\"05_VECTOR_SHAPES\",\"layers\":[{\"name\":\"Top Logo Red Accent Geometry\",\"type\":\"shape\",\"icon\":\"🎨\"},{\"name\":\"Bottom Red Footer Polygon\",\"type\":\"shape\",\"icon\":\"🎨\"},{\"name\":\"Bottom Charcoal Diagonal Polygon\",\"type\":\"shape\",\"icon\":\"🎨\"},{\"name\":\"Bottom White Diagonal Cutout\",\"type\":\"shape\",\"icon\":\"🎨\"},{\"name\":\"Footer Red Contact Icon Squares\",\"type\":\"shape\",\"icon\":\"🎨\"},{\"name\":\"Footer Edge Bleed Extensions\",\"type\":\"shape\",\"icon\":\"🎨\"}]},{\"folder\":\"06_BACKGROUND\",\"layers\":[{\"name\":\"White Paper Base\",\"type\":\"solid_color\",\"icon\":\"🎨\"},{\"name\":\"Subtle Paper Grain Overlay\",\"type\":\"raster\",\"icon\":\"🖌️\"}]}]}'),
(614, 'Dream Studio Corporate Letterhead PSD Template', '', '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a9267313ebae.webp\"]', '[]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/modern-business-corporate-letterhead-template_329592693.htm#fromView=author&page=3&position=46&uuid=9901dd1d-af31-4d42-9940-8f9678e099fe\"]', 1, NULL, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Unassigned', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 0, NULL, '2026-08-29 04:59:59', '2026-08-29 04:59:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-29', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'agentic', '{\"task_title\":\"Dream Studio Corporate Letterhead PSD Template\",\"doc_format\":\"A4 Corporate Letterhead\",\"resolution_mode\":\"300 DPI • CMYK\",\"dimensions\":\"210 x 297 mm\",\"bleed_margin\":\"3 mm All Margins\",\"color_palette\":[{\"name\":\"Primary Charcoal\",\"hex\":\"#292929\"},{\"name\":\"Studio Cyan\",\"hex\":\"#00A9E0\"},{\"name\":\"Body Text Gray\",\"hex\":\"#666666\"},{\"name\":\"Muted Gray\",\"hex\":\"#A7A7A7\"},{\"name\":\"Paper White\",\"hex\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"name\":\"Light Rule Gray\",\"hex\":\"#D9D9D9\"}],\"typography\":[{\"font\":\"Arial\",\"weights\":\"400, 700\",\"usage\":\"Letter body copy, address details, date line and signature information\"},{\"font\":\"Montserrat\",\"weights\":\"600, 700\",\"usage\":\"Dream Studio wordmark, sender name, contact labels and micro-headings\"},{\"font\":\"Roboto Condensed\",\"weights\":\"400, 700\",\"usage\":\"Compact contact information, footer address and small supporting metadata\"}],\"layout_breakdown\":[{\"section\":\"TOP BRAND HEADER\",\"description\":\"White A4 canvas with a charcoal geometric banner entering from the top-left corner, a cyan horizontal accent strip at the upper-right, and the Dream Studio logo positioned below the upper-left graphic.\"},{\"section\":\"LETTER METADATA\",\"description\":\"Compact sender and recipient block below the logo, aligned to the left margin. Includes To, recipient name in cyan, date, address and phone details.\"},{\"section\":\"MAIN LETTER BODY\",\"d